Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 16:56:18 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] D3D12: ambient occlusion prototype (REX_DEV_AO, ao_mode,
 ao_strength)

Computes AO from the scene depth the title copies out of the EDRAM and applies it to the scene color in the EDRAM buffer before each full-screen color copy in that frame. Prototype: shader loaded from a file and compiled at startup.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
